{{de-decl-noun-f|n}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|flag}} {{l|de|Flagge}}, {{l|de|Banner}}, {{l|de|Standarte}}
* {{sense|ideal}} {{l|de|Idee}}, {{l|de|Prinzip}}, {{l|de|Motto}}
* {{sense|smell of alcohol}} {{l|de|Alkoholgeruch}}

